  "rationale": [
    "Every successful read now checks PE header coverage and safe raw/RVA spans, excluding forbidden header/peer overlap before address translation. Native header acceptance is deliberately not the sole admission policy.",
    "The implementation retains the existing96-section cap and uses two sorted interval indexes with O(sectionCount log sectionCount) construction and O(sectionCount) extra storage; it does not repeatedly compare every section pair.",
    "The fresh qualification passed58authored cases,3real-image fact comparisons, strict source verification and91focused tests.20authored cases agree in accepted header facts,30are deliberately stricter rejections,8are rejected by both.",
    "The observed small median cost is5.424332031250145microseconds/read and dense96 cost5.992562500003015microseconds/read. The cost is accepted for deterministic malformed-input admission.",
    "All11predefined adverse metrics,7above5percent including the small minimum, are retained; six above5percent occur among median/p95/p99. Supplemental computed means and signed heap changes are also retained.",
    "No favorable change is used to erase a regression, and no cause is inferred for individual tails, first reads or heap swings. No repeat was run to seek a better result."
  ],
  "qualificationLimits": [
    "One frozen cohort per workload/variant on a shared Linux x64 Node24.19.0 host; team source activity paused and no competing workload observed at preflight. This is not cross-machine statistical inference.",
    "p95/p99 are nearest-rank quantiles of100batch means, not per-call tail distributions.",
    "Signed heapUsed deltas include temporary objects and collection effects; they are not allocation rates, retained-heap totals or peakRSS. No forced GC was used.",
    "No cancellation injection or browser/OS engine matrix was run by this cohort. Tracking issue2417 remains open.",
    "Earlier75f0/6e3native and performance records stay historical and byte-exact. Integrated findings govern this PR update."
